@startuml Sequence_Dashboard_Admin
title Sequence Diagram - Dashboard Admin

actor "Admin" as Admin
boundary "Halaman Dashboard Admin" as GUI
control "DashboardAdminController" as Controller
entity "Tabel User" as DB_User
entity "Tabel Barang" as DB_Barang
entity "Tabel Transaksi" as DB_Transaksi
entity "Tabel Kategori" as DB_Kategori
entity "Tabel seller_profiles" as DB_Seller

Admin -> GUI: 1. Login sebagai Admin atau akses /admin/dashboard
activate GUI
GUI -> Controller: 2. Request data dashboard
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: 3. Cek user adalah Admin

Controller -> DB_User: 4. Query statistik pengguna
activate DB_User
DB_User --> Controller: 5. Total Pengguna, Total Penjual Aktif
deactivate DB_User

Controller -> DB_Seller: 6. Query pengajuan verifikasi pending
activate DB_Seller
DB_Seller --> Controller: 7. Penjual Pending KYC
deactivate DB_Seller

Controller -> DB_Barang: 8. Query statistik barang
activate DB_Barang
DB_Barang --> Controller: 9. Total Barang Aktif
deactivate DB_Barang

Controller -> DB_Transaksi: 10. Query statistik transaksi
activate DB_Transaksi
DB_Transaksi --> Controller: 11. Transaksi Selesai, Transaksi Menunggu
deactivate DB_Transaksi

Controller -> DB_Kategori: 12. Query jumlah kategori
activate DB_Kategori
DB_Kategori --> Controller: 13. Total Kategori
deactivate DB_Kategori

Controller -> DB_Transaksi: 14. Query 5 transaksi terbaru
activate DB_Transaksi
DB_Transaksi --> Controller: 15. Data transaksi terbaru
deactivate DB_Transaksi

Controller -> DB_Seller: 16. Query 5 penjual baru daftar
activate DB_Seller
DB_Seller --> Controller: 17. Data penjual baru
deactivate DB_Seller

Controller --> GUI: 18. Kirim semua data statistik dan aktivitas
deactivate Controller
GUI --> Admin: 19. Tampilkan halaman dashboard dengan:\n- Stats cards (pengguna, barang, transaksi, kategori)\n- Tabel aktivitas terbaru\n- Quick actions menu
deactivate GUI

alt User bukan Admin
    Admin -> GUI: 1a. Login dengan akun non-admin dan akses dashboard
    GUI -> Controller: 2a. Request dashboard
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Controller: 3a. Cek user dan bukan admin
    Controller --> GUI: 4a. Error 403 Akses ditolak
    deactivate Controller
    GUI --> Admin: 5a. Tampilkan error 403 "Akses ditolak"
end

@enduml
